{"id":"wb-6-947","name":"王国维故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"王国维故居","text":"王国维故居位于浙江省海宁市盐官镇建安路4号，是中国近代著名国学大师王国维（1877－1927）的青少年成长地。他在10－22岁曾住于此居后进楼上，后来多次回家居住。\n\n故居占地面积700余平方米，建筑面积近350平方米，始建于1886年，木结构。坐北朝南，共两进（前进为平房，后进为楼房），两进之间有天井和厢房，前后各有庭院。\n\n大门内外分别悬有顾廷龙、朱穆之所题的“王国维故居”匾额，门厅中央置有王国维半身铜像。大厅内陈列他一生十二幅画像和其它资料。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E7%BB%B4%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":86785341,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785341","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9d09093086f14173a994aa2e.jpg","title":"海宁盐官镇王国维故居.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B5%B7%E5%AE%81%E7%9B%90%E5%AE%98%E9%95%87%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E7%BB%B4%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/%E6%B5%B7%E5%AE%81%E7%9B%90%E5%AE%98%E9%95%87%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%E7%BB%B4%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Linjiahui","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA","width":320,"height":240},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}